@startuml
title Assessment -> gap -> treatment -> retest\nDesign v0.2-r1 | 2026-10-17
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam activityBorderColor #334155
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
start
:Check current RBAC and scope for each action;
if (Authorized now?) then (yes)
else (no / expired)
  :Deny action; audit reason;\nno protected read or business change;
  stop
endif
:Capture scenario/context, assessment type,\nprofile/rubric and criteria versions;
if (Essential context valid?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Save validation issues; status=NEEDS_REVIEW;\nscore_determined=false; score/range/level=null;
  stop
endif
:TUC-05/06: verify evidence scope, freshness, source\nand test execution with evidence.verify permission;
note right
  Internal self-assessment is available.
  Consultant review is optional.
  Missing/unverified/expired/wrong-scope evidence
  or INCONCLUSIVE cannot prove control failure.
end note
if (Verified failure?) then (yes)
  :Append NOT_SATISFIED / PARTIALLY_SATISFIED;\nCONTROL_GAP for verified unmet criteria;\nretain EVIDENCE_GAP for other unknown criteria;
else (no)
  if (Verified satisfaction of all criteria?) then (yes)
    :Append SATISFIED with evidence/criteria revisions;
  else (no)
    :Append INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE + EVIDENCE_GAP;\nor NOT_ASSESSED + pending assessment if unattempted;
  endif
endif
:TUC-04: confirm E/F, impact and G per path\nusing ControlAssessment coverage AND strength;\nunverified paths remain UNKNOWN;
if (Input/domain valid?) then (yes)
  :Calculate R25 or bounds from confirmed inputs;\nscore_determined independent of status;\nUNKNOWN/gaps/disputes keep NEEDS_REVIEW;
else (no)
  :Save validation issues; status=NEEDS_REVIEW;\nscore_determined=false; score/range/level=null;
endif
:Append immutable assessment snapshot;\noptional review records disagreement and both findings;\nchanges require a new snapshot, not an overwrite;
:Risk Owner confirms operational priority / treatment\nwith authority, scope and reason;\nacceptance preserves control results and gaps;
if (Treatment / retest requested?) then (yes)
  :Create/update task with owner, deadline and criteria;\nsubmit NEW evidence revision and request retest;
  if (Retest evidence verified and usable?) then (yes)
    :Repeat TUC-06 then TUC-04 with current RBAC;\nappend new ControlAssessment / RiskEvaluation;\ntest may pass, fail or be INCONCLUSIVE;
    :Compare equivalent scenario/context/profile/rubric\nand same CURRENT or INHERENT type;\notherwise record NOT_COMPARABLE;
    :Show R, impact_progress and gap_progress separately;\nkeep verified_worsening and impact summaries;\nno causal attribution from score reduction;
    if (Closure criteria verified and closure authorized?) then (yes)
      :Append explicit gap/task closure decision;
    else (no)
      :Keep relevant gap/task open; record reasons;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Append insufficient-evidence result / NEEDS_REVIEW;\nkeep gap/task open; preserve prior snapshots;
  endif
else (no)
  :Keep assessment, gaps and decisions visible;
endif
:TUC-08: report as-of snapshot;\nshow limitations, review provenance and history;
stop
@enduml
